MODULE: ProbeNeverRefreshes
TARGET: EventualCreateRefusal
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: future admission keeps a pre-registration count forever
PERTURBS: Probe

--- FIND
    /\ observed' = Cardinality(owned)
    /\ allow' = (Cardinality(owned) + 1 <= Effective)
--- REPLACE
    /\ observed' = observed
    /\ allow' = allow
--- END
